  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Purple manor soil is a rank eight immortal material that looks like a patch of soil with purple grains. Purple smoke rises from the ground, then condenses back into even smaller grains that fall onto the soil after rising only half an inch. Fairy Miao Yin treats it as long extinct and as something that appeared only briefly in history because its effect was too powerful. A strand of that purple smoke placed in an aperture can raise a mortal Gu Master’s cultivation level, and enough purple manor soil in an immortal aperture can raise a Gu Immortal’s cultivation level the same way. In the same underground cache, crystal essence is first judged highest in quantity, with water path and lightning path crystal essences named when Black Tigress guesses at Hu Land; those essences are covered on water path crystal essence and lightning path crystal essence. Further search finds earth blood veins and a black-yellow heart in that vault; those finds are covered on earth blood veins and black-yellow heart.",
      "chapters": [
        2076
      ],
